            regarded as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-space"} G-space
            via the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conjugation+action"} conjugation action
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ThePointGroupRepresentation"} (6)
          %p
            Again, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+homotopy+theory"} equivariant homotopy class
            of such a map depends only on the equivariant homotopy type of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
